      ":question/problem": "![](images/42/42c5eefced4b7e41c09466922362a5b5dd66fd5621caeeb5c206a4c6e829bf41.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, $\u25b3ACD$ is equilateral, $AB^(\u2015)\u2245AE^(\u2015)$, and $\u2220BAC\u2245\u2220DAE$.\n\nConsider the following statement:\n\n> $\u25b3BAC\u2245\u25b3EAD$\n\nThe table below gives the proof of the statement. Select the correct options in the table and thus complete the proof.\n\n|  | Statement | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | $\u25b3ACD$ is equilateral | Given |\n| 2 | {{field-1}} | Given |\n| 3 | $\u2220BAC\u2245\u2220DAE$ | Given |\n| 4 | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |\n| 5 | $\u25b3BAC\u2245\u25b3EAD$ | {{field-4}} |"
