      ":question/problem": "![](images/3f/3f2600e1f043c01e0b5a7a1dbbc95b3bd96ae1fe2b9b742e4dc99d36e541ed25.png)\n\nIn the diagram above, $AB^(\u2015)\u2245CD^(\u2015)$ and $AC^(\u2015)\u2245BD^(\u2015)$.\n\nConsider the following statement:\n\n> $\u25b3ABD\u2245\u25b3DCA$\n\nThe table below gives the proof of the statement. Select the correct options in the table and thus complete the proof.\n\n|  | Statement | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| 1 | $AB^(\u2015)\u2245CD^(\u2015)$ | Given |\n| 2 | {{field-1}} | Given |\n| 3 | $AD^(\u2015)\u2245AD^(\u2015)$, | {{field-2}} |\n| 4 | $\u25b3ABD\u2245\u25b3DCA$ | {{field-3}} |"
